WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.557
A common workflow is to load data into a DataFrame, register it as a temporary view,

00:00:05.557 --> 00:00:07.732
and then query it with SQL.

00:00:07.732 --> 00:00:13.372
The temporary view is not the same as a permanent database view from Module 12.

00:00:13.372 --> 00:00:18.237
It is usually session-scoped and useful inside notebooks or jobs.

00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:24.347
Spark DataFrames and Spark SQL are two interfaces to the same underlying engine.

00:00:24.347 --> 00:00:32.022
You can prepare data with DataFrame operations, register a temporary view, and query it with familiar SQL.

00:00:32.022 --> 00:00:36.480
Choose the interface that makes the transformation easiest to read and maintain.
